{"title":"Anomalía de Ebstein-2026","guid":"","filepath":"/Users/criaah/Vault/📚 Resources/Mapas-Mentales/Apuntes-de-Clases/Cardiogeriatria-2026/IC-paciente-fragil-sindrome-cardiogeriatrico.smmx","root":{"id":"0","parent":"-1","text":"IC en el paciente frágil — síndrome cardiogeriátrico","guid":"JDJLMWZyRM-9Q-4REWfdSA","children":[{"id":"1","parent":"0","text":"Definición y concepto","guid":"IeFMDSzKRIeesSmtBz02zQ","children":[{"id":"2","parent":"1","text":"Síndrome cardiogeriátrico → convergencia IC + fragilidad","guid":"NjdSC_yJTnOzDTrc3cnjXA","children":[]},{"id":"3","parent":"1","text":"Relación BIDIRECCIONAL → IC empeora fragilidad, fragilidad empeora IC","guid":"Bk2tq0u4RTWoMiUcg7l2iw","children":[]},{"id":"4","parent":"1","text":"Ciclo vicioso → inflamación → sarcopenia → desacondicionamiento → IC ↑","guid":"onNdi5ffQ1un6oBEecF7eg","children":[]},{"id":"5","parent":"1","text":"NO es solo \"IC en viejo\" → es una ENTIDAD CLÍNICA distinta","guid":"FYK9clfdSYSH6S0SejVgMw","children":[]},{"id":"6","parent":"1","text":"Paradigma invertido → frágiles obtienen MAYOR beneficio de intervenciones","guid":"fSG7qEZ5SmC6386Ux1kxNQ","children":[]},{"id":"7","parent":"1","text":"Fragilidad NO es contraindicación → es indicación de MAYOR CUIDADO","guid":"wKPmGkVPQHqRfGyOCGYpkg","children":[]}]},{"id":"8","parent":"0","text":"Epidemiología","guid":"uM8tmubGSVWKvp6Di6JE7Q","children":[{"id":"9","parent":"8","text":"Prevalencia fragilidad en IC → 22-54% según escala","guid":"_J2tauqtSG6UZDZDrmTB6g","children":[]},{"id":"10","parent":"8","text":"IC es la PRIMERA causa de hospitalización en >65 años","guid":"8JfJduh_TUys1cp3Ux6jrQ","children":[]},{"id":"11","parent":"8","text":"Prevalencia IC en >80 años → 10-20%","guid":"J3x_mfv1TjqN83LrHF4F_g","children":[]},{"id":"12","parent":"8","text":"Mortalidad 1 año en IC + frágil → HR 2.26 vs no frágil","guid":"gRgP_A-VTOWJmCsugR4nBA","children":[]},{"id":"13","parent":"8","text":"Rehospitalización → HR 2.06 evento combinado muerte/reingreso","guid":"VQ8VjGkAQXSeeTGr0hHZXw","children":[]},{"id":"14","parent":"8","text":"50% NO recupera nivel funcional previo post-hospitalización","guid":"TS_NsffnSg6bqc3j1z8A5w","children":[]},{"id":"15","parent":"8","text":"Efecto más fuerte en HOMBRES","guid":"A4H4FAy1R_Cp0KI8q_ByRA","children":[]},{"id":"16","parent":"8","text":"Depresión → factor INDEPENDIENTE de reingreso por IC (Kihon Checklist)","guid":"HWy3kKeJTo6EuijDPxL_FQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"17","parent":"0","text":"Fisiopatología — binomio IC + fragilidad","guid":"cR7ffhDeTg6Dqbwrs1qzmQ","children":[{"id":"18","parent":"17","text":"Inflamación crónica compartida","guid":"ATM1xP3DRG6joE03clPikg","children":[{"id":"19","parent":"18","text":"IL-6, TNF-α, PCR ↑ → comunes a ambas","guid":"k92Si3OZRMOdVoW2T3si9Q","children":[]},{"id":"20","parent":"18","text":"Activación inmune innata persistente","guid":"pqXVxhKhRLWqXsxNfm0-cg","children":[]},{"id":"21","parent":"18","text":"Endotoxemia de bajo grado (intestino permeable en IC)","guid":"Knmrgk52RQWT6RZPqVk5iQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"22","parent":"17","text":"Activación neurohormonal","guid":"4GPHKIB8RleNYTGcr2snCA","children":[{"id":"23","parent":"22","text":"SRAA sobreactivado → retención + catabolismo","guid":"NfQdShfgRhel7KS8lcPGgg","children":[]},{"id":"24","parent":"22","text":"Sistema simpático → gasto energético ↑ sin beneficio","guid":"I7RjhZgLTEeXx3I0pW0vkw","children":[]},{"id":"25","parent":"22","text":"Resistencia anabólica → testosterona ↓, IGF-1 ↓, DHEA-S ↓","guid":"JnDN4jvbRpKhgifLmX6tMQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"26","parent":"17","text":"Sarcopenia cardíaca → concepto Bozkurt JACC 2021","guid":"gcD8Z_rVTMmBo9exqA60Iw","children":[{"id":"27","parent":"26","text":"Pérdida masa muscular esquelética + cardíaca","guid":"EBlj8vrIQ3-h0k2_uIazUg","children":[]},{"id":"28","parent":"26","text":"Miopatía del diafragma → disnea de esfuerzo desproporcionada","guid":"Z7BY51BLRTaUi61zSFX4xg","children":[]},{"id":"29","parent":"26","text":"Criterios EWGSOP2 → fuerza + masa + rendimiento","guid":"6CAyAFFKSNmWQuZ4Phn7FQ","children":[]},{"id":"30","parent":"26","text":"Prevalencia sarcopenia en IC → 20-50%","guid":"qepSR5kvRdyWWE3b5hsDzA","children":[]},{"id":"31","parent":"26","text":"Wasting cardíaco → caquexia → punto sin retorno","guid":"m0ZKWRVyQ1aj6Lxk40a4MA","children":[]}]},{"id":"32","parent":"17","text":"Anemia y déficit de hierro","guid":"U48LwPPUTW6sG1ZLr_hu7g","children":[{"id":"33","parent":"32","text":"Prevalencia déficit Fe en IC → ~50%","guid":"AuHYVPYXRxa7ry78uFcMoQ","children":[]},{"id":"34","parent":"32","text":"Ferritina <100 o Sat transferrina <20% (IC específica)","guid":"qweyoymST8-YbmpOr2pbJg","children":[]},{"id":"35","parent":"32","text":"Contribuye a fatigabilidad → ↓ capacidad ejercicio","guid":"ODyVevdZQSmWm2_HLVt4Qw","children":[]},{"id":"36","parent":"32","text":"Anemia funcional → hipoperfusión tisular","guid":"dRaIXks0RN-VxJtit7XZpw","children":[]}]},{"id":"37","parent":"17","text":"Desacondicionamiento progresivo","guid":"d_1jq0yHTA6Z1fAmq-eYXw","children":[{"id":"38","parent":"37","text":"Reposo → pérdida 1-3% masa muscular/día","guid":"XaoU1G94Th2hzexnCQ4wxQ","children":[]},{"id":"39","parent":"37","text":"Hospitalización → catalizador de espiral descendente","guid":"p-IjUsyEQyah4Ceog30w8g","children":[]},{"id":"40","parent":"37","text":"Inactividad física → VO₂ peak ↓ → disnea ↑ → más inactividad","guid":"LFRZ5cp7T72zRFQNtvo5Pg","children":[]}]},{"id":"41","parent":"17","text":"Hipoperfusión cerebral","guid":"WwU4M3JnTo6WFIyR0jaP2w","children":[{"id":"42","parent":"41","text":"Bajo gasto cardíaco → hipoperfusión frontal","guid":"t69j0teaRkWfx_E8HAyO5w","children":[]},{"id":"43","parent":"41","text":"Deterioro cognitivo subclínico → mala adherencia tratamiento","guid":"DpLIjzdESFi9VhufhrF5Ew","children":[]},{"id":"44","parent":"41","text":"Delirium intrahospitalario en IC descompensada","guid":"Y2nJfKbjQxSAU4b7ztHgqw","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"45","parent":"0","text":"Evaluación","guid":"-zBi4a6DSNqHndhf5_pvNw","children":[{"id":"46","parent":"45","text":"Fragilidad → OBLIGATORIA en todo IC ≥65 años","guid":"VAwDIxMcTzGpHY-4_sDUfA","children":[{"id":"47","parent":"46","text":"Clinical Frailty Scale (CFS) → 1-9 puntos","guid":"cAE82xm6Qkm4ufP87whhJQ","children":[{"id":"48","parent":"47","text":"CFS 1-4 → robusto a vulnerable","guid":"7qvj63HRRKWTgp3L5VtVEw","children":[]},{"id":"49","parent":"47","text":"CFS 5-6 → frágil leve-moderado","guid":"9sXu1DAGRNWwTcZVZWdANg","children":[]},{"id":"50","parent":"47","text":"CFS 7-9 → frágil severo","guid":"lSLviuX-QzmerSVmvH6fzQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"51","parent":"46","text":"FRAIL Scale → 5 ítems (acrónimo)","guid":"OtzuFolxT3GkOi4COb9Bxg","children":[{"id":"52","parent":"51","text":"Fatigue, Resistance, Ambulation, Illness, Loss of weight","guid":"ouAt88VRQ7y8nw4-krfwSg","children":[]},{"id":"53","parent":"51","text":"0 robusto, 1-2 prefrágil, ≥3 frágil","guid":"czIwlTbnTUi_Ut1LF1iG_Q","children":[]}]},{"id":"54","parent":"46","text":"Fenotipo de Fried → gold standard investigación","guid":"WHyUrQQhQ82KLwF9dHtHag","children":[{"id":"55","parent":"54","text":"5 criterios → pérdida peso, agotamiento, debilidad (grip), lentitud, baja actividad","guid":"ISe8lqbNSlOT2aKVu0C8Kw","children":[]},{"id":"56","parent":"54","text":"≥3 criterios = frágil","guid":"KTjaOzBJTEWSMD1o_5vG-Q","children":[]}]},{"id":"57","parent":"46","text":"Velocidad marcha <0.8 m/s → predictor INDEPENDIENTE mortalidad","guid":"aFLRDLaKSOWFrHTHO0fGZw","children":[]},{"id":"58","parent":"46","text":"SPPB <8/12 → deterioro funcional significativo","guid":"YdV3qQ5AQdyjxrSM7FpZcA","children":[]}]},{"id":"59","parent":"45","text":"Heart Failure Frailty Score (HFFS) 2025","guid":"FxbYLTCzTv2U49HiEvsKDw","children":[{"id":"60","parent":"59","text":"PRIMERA herramienta ESPECÍFICA para IC","guid":"8HjNbGLhRLe0XzVY5J1LcA","children":[]},{"id":"61","parent":"59","text":"Consenso Delphi → 54 expertos internacionales","guid":"peqVgP_0TwiwzqGFpt0cUA","children":[]},{"id":"62","parent":"59","text":"22 variables en 4 dominios","guid":"hZH69926SDGWQg-bIf4yGw","children":[{"id":"63","parent":"62","text":"Clínico","guid":"zmX3Nm54TeOmzmObZKa1Sg","children":[]},{"id":"64","parent":"62","text":"Funcional","guid":"4yiZzRTmSE2hN_k94MQUOw","children":[]},{"id":"65","parent":"62","text":"Psico-cognitivo","guid":"jrrPWMjbRzK_Z0ptzYkWuw","children":[]},{"id":"66","parent":"62","text":"Social","guid":"2w5SXWBqRk6gBFwT5uLXgA","children":[]}]},{"id":"67","parent":"59","text":"Versión corta S-HFFS → 10 variables para uso diario","guid":"SrCd-9HRR6yCmTO6rXc5qg","children":[]},{"id":"68","parent":"59","text":"DOI: 10.1002/ehf2.15187 | ESC Heart Failure 2025","guid":"4sOugDHHQWumt5Fcg7lO1A","children":[]}]},{"id":"69","parent":"45","text":"Essential Frailty Toolset (EFT) → específico TAVI","guid":"kqtBsu-VQcOVD829GExcxQ","children":[{"id":"70","parent":"69","text":"5 componentes → Chair stand, Hb, Albúmina, MMSE, AVD","guid":"Bc2KmYrPRASpsY-xTs4P-g","children":[]},{"id":"71","parent":"69","text":"Identifica déficits REVERSIBLES","guid":"U3AKRPBsSIS34c6DdbrEJg","children":[]}]},{"id":"72","parent":"45","text":"Biomarcadores","guid":"QgIz2Ob_QZqyXlVCfuBQnQ","children":[{"id":"73","parent":"72","text":"NT-proBNP → CAVEAT en frágil","guid":"qYL4IQxgQRa_EIEWGtQZ6w","children":[{"id":"74","parent":"73","text":"Valores más altos basales por edad y comorbilidad","guid":"jBZOqEBtTaa3IXbDxv_Pzg","children":[]},{"id":"75","parent":"73","text":"Usar tendencia, no valor absoluto aislado","guid":"zHC8PJOnS2aIxveFaji0OQ","children":[]},{"id":"76","parent":"73","text":"Corte >450 pg/mL en <50a, >900 en 50-75a, >1800 en >75a","guid":"7gUTZq8zT6iYqo5IdoIXZA","children":[]}]},{"id":"77","parent":"72","text":"Albúmina → marcador nutricional y pronóstico","guid":"fH8RYobTRHCAKZTcH0O0Vg","children":[]},{"id":"78","parent":"72","text":"PCR ultrasensible → inflamación sistémica","guid":"l9T2m1KJTAGDKPdE4jYLKw","children":[]},{"id":"79","parent":"72","text":"Hemoglobina → anemia contribuye a fragilidad","guid":"nT15ZGW9QnmYd46-qm_P6g","children":[]},{"id":"80","parent":"72","text":"Ferritina + Sat transferrina → déficit hierro funcional","guid":"hYaOrQxDR_moY2MJ58h69A","children":[]}]},{"id":"81","parent":"45","text":"Funcional","guid":"7B7EV-1MTjCDy2ABhxC4rw","children":[{"id":"82","parent":"81","text":"Barthel → dependencia en ABVD","guid":"qitxz_3PSm2D-YUA3n7guw","children":[]},{"id":"83","parent":"81","text":"Lawton-Brody → AIVD","guid":"jyj7PF5bQsu4sy4M0OpOfQ","children":[]},{"id":"84","parent":"81","text":"Test de marcha 6 minutos → capacidad funcional","guid":"QQoUNW5XQU6lYh6XH3Vb4g","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"85","parent":"0","text":"Tratamiento farmacológico","guid":"H6Y-Z1h3RWixASW9hvhjnQ","children":[{"id":"86","parent":"85","text":"IECA/ARA2 → base del tratamiento ICFEr","guid":"NnvTZ62-SkCeJgaFk5d1ng","children":[{"id":"87","parent":"86","text":"Iniciar dosis BAJA en frágil → enalapril 2.5 mg","guid":"7F7tH-uXTRCdthyYUg54Jg","children":[]},{"id":"88","parent":"86","text":"Titular lentamente → cada 2-4 semanas","guid":"EA9y8jiBSp2OhX64ETtshA","children":[]},{"id":"89","parent":"86","text":"Monitorizar función renal y K+","guid":"SqwGxfTfT86vyT8d-YxFlA","children":[]},{"id":"90","parent":"86","text":"Hipotensión → principal limitante en frágil","guid":"IolK0YztTNm52yEDCPHPEQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"91","parent":"85","text":"ARNI (sacubitril/valsartán)","guid":"yYQohWXoRHmkLKo_V_JS9A","children":[{"id":"92","parent":"91","text":"Beneficio mantenido en >75 años","guid":"albkoihhQkKw3XjpYwxqyQ","children":[]},{"id":"93","parent":"91","text":"Iniciar 24/26 mg BID en frágil","guid":"GA39QDTNQ_iJYoUDGVwdWA","children":[]},{"id":"94","parent":"91","text":"↓ mortalidad CV 3.2% y hospitalización IC 21%","guid":"3Qt4P27iQTipdO7CjrWHIg","children":[]},{"id":"95","parent":"91","text":"Precaución → hipotensión sintomática en frágil","guid":"ArL3499cTJOR-nx7-rC28Q","children":[]}]},{"id":"96","parent":"85","text":"Betabloqueantes","guid":"DEj5KJg0S_eyK9UhsTELgw","children":[{"id":"97","parent":"96","text":"Titulación MUY LENTA en frágil → \"start low, go SLOWER\"","guid":"cCVfSxmyS8eEw0sH8Fr-Eg","children":[]},{"id":"98","parent":"96","text":"Carvedilol 3.125 mg BID → titular cada 4 semanas","guid":"cEGdttl2Qvy70HwLWIkdHQ","children":[]},{"id":"99","parent":"96","text":"Bisoprolol 1.25 mg/día como alternativa","guid":"B84jz4YgTiqXMocOC1kk6A","children":[]},{"id":"100","parent":"96","text":"Nebivolol → evidencia en >70 años (SENIORS)","guid":"9lzIAx8-TZuJyg7vMyvVAg","children":[]},{"id":"101","parent":"96","text":"Bradicardia → precaución si FC basal <60","guid":"Uq1flgLzRT2qGmQaWYkoVQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"102","parent":"85","text":"iSGLT2 → PRIMERA LÍNEA incluso en frágil","guid":"qkMbzOagTTqwzt2kuQwgMg","children":[{"id":"103","parent":"102","text":"Empagliflozina 10 mg o dapagliflozina 10 mg","guid":"MFof6EpJQFOyIUdCpzYHAg","children":[]},{"id":"104","parent":"102","text":"Beneficio CV CONSISTENTE en TODOS los estratos fragilidad","guid":"dxh_nqIqQFq89LZRNH_Wmg","children":[]},{"id":"105","parent":"102","text":"Mayor mejoría función física en los MÁS frágiles","guid":"gP85I1giSRaIT7LoywUxqg","children":[]},{"id":"106","parent":"102","text":"NO requiere ajuste por fragilidad → dosis fija","guid":"yOjmitWIRDWL-QtWtg7L2w","children":[]},{"id":"107","parent":"102","text":"Beneficio en ICFEr, ICFEmr e ICFEp → EMPEROR-Preserved","guid":"W9E0UqvDRYejvF9aPI-2jg","children":[]},{"id":"108","parent":"102","text":"Efectos adicionales → diurético osmótico, cardioprotección, nefroprotección","guid":"JVMAHV6nSFaEldWeVT6LKQ","children":[]},{"id":"109","parent":"102","text":"ACC 2024 Expert Consensus → seguros en frágiles","guid":"81roaYukQlawrj_ANteU0Q","children":[]}]},{"id":"110","parent":"85","text":"ARM (espironolactona/eplerenona)","guid":"xL-YhfCHR66zCsvOjA3FzA","children":[{"id":"111","parent":"110","text":"Espironolactona 12.5-25 mg en frágil","guid":"mVtPFcB5Say51UZ4sad1tA","children":[]},{"id":"112","parent":"110","text":"Monitorizar K+ y función renal estrictamente","guid":"EjrUSzyqTZO1-WKclwOdGw","children":[]},{"id":"113","parent":"110","text":"Riesgo hiperpotasemia en ERC + IECA","guid":"9wpCyHL3R5mgjC9pqu3_7A","children":[]}]},{"id":"114","parent":"85","text":"Hierro IV → carboximaltosa férrica","guid":"GfslHOZ9QIewgLecb-Qg2Q","children":[{"id":"115","parent":"114","text":"Indicación → ferritina <100 o Sat Tf <20% + IC","guid":"i59GujXiT8GAF2jruEkGXQ","children":[]},{"id":"116","parent":"114","text":"AFFIRM-AHF → ↓ hospitalización IC (RR 0.74)","guid":"fUxTiDvYTUiiyS4hPbNdyw","children":[]},{"id":"117","parent":"114","text":"Dosis según peso y Hb → infusión 15-30 min","guid":"IJK5fY0mRJ6eFTLc3lOF8w","children":[]},{"id":"118","parent":"114","text":"Seguro en AM → sin ajuste por edad","guid":"p1acN8DRScCVVyVveGlqDg","children":[]},{"id":"119","parent":"114","text":"Repetir cada 3-6 meses según ferrocinética","guid":"JRPzwOd5QaO8FCrPynuahw","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"120","parent":"0","text":"GDMT en fragilidad → principios generales","guid":"jFxGke9WQLm9m5L5vCIfJA","children":[{"id":"121","parent":"120","text":"\"Start low, go slow, but DON'T GO NOWHERE\"","guid":"YwRUxhfbRK6r3SQKXi5ttw","children":[]},{"id":"122","parent":"120","text":"Priorizar fármacos con MAYOR beneficio → iSGLT2 primero","guid":"m66_u1bTRrixpXezr4d_wQ","children":[]},{"id":"123","parent":"120","text":"Cuádruple terapia → IECA/ARNI + BB + ARM + iSGLT2","guid":"ctUg9wL7SSysISubqUl2Lw","children":[]},{"id":"124","parent":"120","text":"Titular secuencialmente, no simultáneamente","guid":"5nRRJPzKQ8eLU5DnZdj0uA","children":[]},{"id":"125","parent":"120","text":"Tolerar PA sistólica 100-110 mmHg si asintomático","guid":"FXfmwGLDQ1S3_bo2HE0BcQ","children":[]},{"id":"126","parent":"120","text":"ACC 2024 → fragilidad NO excluye de terapia óptima","guid":"z_J1BKqPQxCoBSkPiyZU5Q","children":[]}]},{"id":"127","parent":"0","text":"STOPPFrail en fragilidad severa","guid":"XqXjZzyTSMeoQ6kYzudTyg","children":[{"id":"128","parent":"127","text":"Criterios → esperanza vida <1 año, CFS ≥7","guid":"89uUn2E9TpGVNJkb8PGwog","children":[]},{"id":"129","parent":"127","text":"Deprescripción de estatinas → sin beneficio a corto plazo","guid":"KHlxgT8ATnqrq_cqJuvC8Q","children":[]},{"id":"130","parent":"127","text":"Suspender bifosfonatos","guid":"hd7GxI7mQA6YnfWlXt7Z_Q","children":[]},{"id":"131","parent":"127","text":"Revisar antihipertensivos → reducir si PA <120/70","guid":"DtvoKwezQ-yJuiDnxDQE7g","children":[]},{"id":"132","parent":"127","text":"Mantener → analgesia, anticoagulación (si FA), IC core therapy","guid":"Q_E2b7v2TBiLhQG-o5E_Bw","children":[]}]},{"id":"133","parent":"0","text":"Dispositivos en frágil","guid":"j5fHyNmPRhiY0OxL63AasQ","children":[{"id":"134","parent":"133","text":"DAI (desfibrilador) → decisión compleja","guid":"N6p-SVMlRr-qGouiRUldiA","children":[{"id":"135","parent":"134","text":"Prevención primaria → cuestionable si CFS ≥7","guid":"SIzrRcWaRFOSt_a8b15H-Q","children":[]},{"id":"136","parent":"134","text":"Considerar esperanza vida >1 año como requisito","guid":"vfAAzlm9QTOecsh2QecyoA","children":[]},{"id":"137","parent":"134","text":"Desactivación en contexto paliativo → conversar ANTES","guid":"qsf-Jw4xTnyZvdoYCzcD6g","children":[]}]},{"id":"138","parent":"133","text":"TRC (resincronización) → beneficio mantenido en >80 años","guid":"BrZlL6PrRdmUC9ScqYC08Q","children":[{"id":"139","parent":"138","text":"Mejora síntomas independiente comorbilidades","guid":"n8oCYGZzRASTMOFv8bA00Q","children":[]},{"id":"140","parent":"138","text":"Tasas complicaciones similares a jóvenes","guid":"F_WXAdS5TVGCD3w86YBP5Q","children":[]},{"id":"141","parent":"138","text":"Considerar incluso en frágiles si BCRI + ICFEr","guid":"JYBrSD6UR_uey_LadyGV3A","children":[]}]},{"id":"142","parent":"133","text":"TAVI → evaluación geriátrica OBLIGATORIA","guid":"Sr-GFT_TS96iJVkmqy7kPA","children":[{"id":"143","parent":"142","text":"VGI predice outcomes MEJOR que STS/EuroSCORE solos","guid":"hnRuHd5iQTOF1G46Jcf04w","children":[]},{"id":"144","parent":"142","text":"Gait speed <0.8 m/s → predictor mortalidad post-TAVI","guid":"Xv2EwWMNRaekulqUE3ooKA","children":[]},{"id":"145","parent":"142","text":"EFT identifica déficits reversibles pre-TAVI","guid":"a6C79ZCDR9OILpvb31nqCg","children":[]},{"id":"146","parent":"142","text":"Prehabilitación 2-4 semanas pre-TAVI → ↓ complicaciones","guid":"dAKQo0cKSAi15Y_f5aOObw","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"147","parent":"0","text":"Rehabilitación cardíaca adaptada","guid":"euaexM8wQ82r4_kYspXZ4A","children":[{"id":"148","parent":"147","text":"REHAB-HF → NEJM 2021 (Kitzman et al.)","guid":"PlHoQ3DfQjifzPqdkGLppA","children":[{"id":"149","parent":"148","text":"n=349, edad media 72 años, 97% frágiles/prefrágiles","guid":"psYh1iaYT_y2jvhpA38zrA","children":[]},{"id":"150","parent":"148","text":"Intervención MULTIDOMINIO (no solo aeróbico)","guid":"gjTkqFY0Q0apMslA3YMRvA","children":[{"id":"151","parent":"150","text":"Fuerza + equilibrio + movilidad + resistencia","guid":"M1Wt1ME-Su27A6eGDHtD4A","children":[]}]},{"id":"152","parent":"148","text":"SPPB → 8.3 vs 6.9 (p<0.001) → Δ 1.5 puntos","guid":"3q9alU7LSmqKGffcWam8dw","children":[]},{"id":"153","parent":"148","text":"Frágiles obtienen MAYOR beneficio que prefrágiles","guid":"8Fj5wOxxRT25rJSJ8CjD-w","children":[]},{"id":"154","parent":"148","text":"SIN aumento eventos adversos","guid":"Evk-kfaBT6S0nPo5mipAZg","children":[]}]},{"id":"155","parent":"147","text":"Meta-análisis Jiang 2025 / Ijaz 2022","guid":"5wJSpRsWQIqDwdAA7A5SSg","children":[{"id":"156","parent":"155","text":"HR 0.77 evento compuesto muerte + reingreso","guid":"0b4S-3njSNGiVC2fRxxgQQ","children":[]},{"id":"157","parent":"155","text":"HR 0.67 mortalidad total","guid":"jVp_4Sc0QFS4DN1MNy5jVA","children":[]},{"id":"158","parent":"155","text":"Beneficio en ICFEp también","guid":"MLMRZ-g2Q_-JqMAKZR5Akw","children":[]}]},{"id":"159","parent":"147","text":"Prescripción ejercicio como MEDICINA","guid":"a7PRFT8AQGCDxuFupbODVA","children":[{"id":"160","parent":"159","text":"Aeróbico moderado → 20 min, 3x/semana, Borg 12-14","guid":"hv0cFneEQcCPLslaalPbug","children":[]},{"id":"161","parent":"159","text":"Resistencia → bandas elásticas, pesas livianas","guid":"Sw5833GtSq6UaMQOXA4iNQ","children":[]},{"id":"162","parent":"159","text":"Equilibrio → Tai Chi, ejercicios propioceptivos","guid":"W87E-gx_T96HUQfhIYrfAw","children":[]},{"id":"163","parent":"159","text":"Progresión → individualizada según tolerancia","guid":"AANSvMnUTUG4mowIK0s9HQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"164","parent":"147","text":"Prehabilitación pre-procedimiento","guid":"ruMHnyQGRpSpXub7k4irTQ","children":[{"id":"165","parent":"164","text":"2-4 semanas antes de TAVI/cirugía","guid":"Zjn9Jy6YQ1mUm83L6Uibpw","children":[]},{"id":"166","parent":"164","text":"↓ complicaciones postoperatorias","guid":"2PzPHzlPQo62CUUXzKD21g","children":[]},{"id":"167","parent":"164","text":"↓ estancia hospitalaria","guid":"31YYfQtZTYCbbjUgYZl3Pg","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"168","parent":"0","text":"Paradoja de los 30 días","guid":"MwzgSt_OReOF1ELFqDpI7g","children":[{"id":"169","parent":"168","text":"Período de MÁXIMA vulnerabilidad post-alta","guid":"alC-ldR9Q06qjzifCZbxsg","children":[]},{"id":"170","parent":"168","text":"Mayor tasa mortalidad y reingreso","guid":"s0Z1Jht0SYq8FxqhPwaV-A","children":[]},{"id":"171","parent":"168","text":"Intervención → seguimiento telefónico 48-72h","guid":"BMy3fev4RRuIynZTmwVfYQ","children":[]},{"id":"172","parent":"168","text":"Consulta precoz → 7-14 días post-alta","guid":"y_qXBR86RGanjtlkJor1Rw","children":[]},{"id":"173","parent":"168","text":"Ajuste farmacológico ambulatorio temprano","guid":"7ed253pQSuiSEJbWclCn5A","children":[]},{"id":"174","parent":"168","text":"Rehabilitación cardíaca domiciliaria precoz","guid":"Emhby_I2Rc6QkFqlOJ64ng","children":[]}]},{"id":"175","parent":"0","text":"Pronóstico","guid":"9jGdrafeRxGBkpR91HsyIg","children":[{"id":"176","pa